Third-party code
----------------

1) src/cbottle/
   From NVIDIA cBottle (Apache-2.0):
     https://github.com/NVlabs/cBottle
   Closest upstream commit to this snapshot:
     57d45b10d6ed7b9f9a16ac0e92238ee5b52c9979 (2025-11-25)
   Modified in this repository:
     - __init__.py: SuperResolutionModel re-export removed.
     - datasets/dataset_3d.py: added the "miroc" VariableConfig (tas, sst)
       used by scripts/train_miroc6_base.py.
     - training/video/frame_masker.py: the mask is cast to the target dtype
       before it is concatenated with the condition.
     - Empty __init__.py stubs added for packaging (config/,
       config/training/, datasets/, training/, training/video/).
   All other modules under src/cbottle/ are unmodified.

   Copyright (c) 2025 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES.
   See SPDX headers in those files.

2) scripts/sda/score.py
   Score-based Data Assimilation utilities descending from
   Rozet & Louppe, NeurIPS 2023:
     https://arxiv.org/abs/2306.10574
     https://github.com/francois-rozet/sda
   File carries NVIDIA/cBottle-style Apache-2.0 headers as present in the
   local cBottle scripts/sda copy this tree was taken from.

3) scripts/training_loop_base.py
   Unmodified copy of scripts/train_coarse.py from NVIDIA cBottle
   (Apache-2.0), upstream commit bf09a97b165cfb3716deb0127b81db7b3feb72fe
   (2025-11-07). Used as the base class for the GenDA training loops.

Everything else under scripts/ (data prep, the training loops in
train_miroc6_base.py and train_ocean_prior.py, the dataloader, OSSE /
real-obs reconstruction, reconstruct_common.py) is GenDA project code.
